refused: d340_div_on_a_secret.cy:6:26, line 6 column 26
 6 |     let $d: u32.secret = $key div.trunc 2;
   |                          ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 what: `div` and `mod` take longer for some values on most CPUs
 why:  a secret mustn't affect how long the program takes, so `div` and `mod` with a secret on either side are refused (D340)
